<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Token Radar — pre-token protocols ranked by implied launch value</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="masthead">
  <div class="masthead-inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="ring r1"></span><span class="ring r2"></span><span class="ring r3"></span><span class="blip"></span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h1>TOKEN RADAR</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Every protocol that still records no token, ranked by what its launch would be worth.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="snapshot-line" id="snapshot-line">Sealed DefiLlama snapshot</p>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="stats" id="stats" aria-label="Board totals"></section>

  <section class="method" aria-label="How the board is built">
    <h2>How this board is built</h2>
    <p class="formula" id="formula"></p>
    <ul class="method-notes" id="method-notes"></ul>
    <div class="multiples">
      <h3>Peer multiples from this snapshot (median market cap / TVL of tokenized protocols)</h3>
      <div class="multiple-chips" id="multiple-chips"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="board-view">
    <div class="controls" role="search">
      <label class="control grow">Search
        <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Protocol name or slug" autocomplete="off">
      </label>
      <label class="control">Category
        <select id="category"><option value="">All categories</option></select>
      </label>
      <label class="control">Chain
        <select id="chain"><option value="">All chains</option></select>
      </label>
      <label class="control check">
        <input id="watch-only" type="checkbox"> Watchlist only
      </label>
      <p class="count" id="count"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table id="board">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th data-sort="rank" class="num">#</th>
            <th data-sort="name">Protocol</th>
            <th data-sort="chains">Chains</th>
            <th data-sort="tvl" class="num">TVL</th>
            <th data-sort="change" class="num">7d</th>
            <th data-sort="days" class="num">No-token run</th>
            <th data-sort="multiple" class="num">Multiple</th>
            <th data-sort="implied" class="num">Implied value</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="rows"></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="hint">Click a column heading to sort. Click any row for the protocol's detail view and its farm plan.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="detail-view" hidden>
    <button class="back" id="back" type="button">&larr; Back to the board</button>
    <div id="detail"></div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p id="source-line"></p>
    <p>“Records no token” is what the snapshot says: DefiLlama carries no gecko id and no symbol for these protocols. An implied value is this board's own estimate of what a launch would price at if the protocol's record stayed as it is — it is not a prediction that a token will be issued, and it is not financial advice.</p>
  </footer>
</main>

<script src="../data.js"></script>
<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```
